# Optional GIF search, using a public browser GIPHY API key.
# Create a Web API key at https://developers.giphy.com/ .
# GIPHY Search is client-side per their integration guide; use a rate-limited key.
# Without the key, users still get 10 original, locally hosted animated reaction GIFs and can send GIPHY links.
# NOTE: VITE_ variables are included in the public browser bundle: treat this as a public web API key.
# GIPHY's beta key has a limited quota; don't bundle or redistribute GIPHY content locally.
VITE_GIPHY_API_KEY=

# Production only:
# VITE_API_URL=https://api.your-domain.example
# CLIENT_ORIGIN=https://your-domain.example
# PORT=3001
# Hold an interrupted conversation while a mobile tab/PWA is suspended (15 minutes).
# RECONNECT_GRACE_MS=900000
